Package: ADCPeptideMapper
Title: ADC Peptide Mapper — In-silico Digest & Transition List Generator
Version: 0.8.0
Date: 2026-06-13
Authors@R: person("Nishikant", "Wase", email = "nishikant.wase@gmail.com",
                   role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: >
  R Shiny application for Antibody-Drug Conjugate (ADC) peptide mapping:
  in-silico proteolytic digestion, uniqueness filtering against Human /
  Cynomolgus Monkey / Rat backgrounds, drug-to-antibody ratio (DAR) modeling,
  linker biotransformation variable mods, multi-instrument MRM/DIA transition
  list generation (Skyline, Thermo, SCIEX, Bruker, Agilent, Waters), and
  an AI-powered assistant tab (Anthropic Claude API).
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
